      "text": "```\n  64-bit name  32-bit view  16-bit  8-bit high  8-bit low\n  -----------  -----------  ------  ----------  ---------\n  RAX          EAX          AX      AH          AL\n  RBX          EBX          BX      BH          BL\n  RCX          ECX          CX      CH          CL\n  RDX          EDX          DX      DH          DL\n  RSI          ESI          SI                  SIL\n  RDI          EDI          DI                  DIL\n  RSP          ESP          SP                  SPL\n  RBP          EBP          BP                  BPL\n  R8           R8D          R8W                 R8B\n  R9           R9D          R9W                 R9B\n  R10          R10D         R10W                R10B\n  R11          R11D         R11W                R11B\n  R12          R12D         R12W                R12B\n  R13          R13D         R13W                R13B\n  R14          R14D         R14W                R14B\n  R15          R15D         R15W                R15B"
    },
